    "Name": "Starslayer",
    "Details": "A Star League era mech, the Starslayer was intended to replace the Crab as the SLDF’s standard medium chassis, though politics kept it from seeing full production until 2781. A 50 ton medium mech, the Starslayer is powered by a 250-rated fusion core and has 5 JJ’s for maximum mobility. The STY-2C carries 2 Large Lasers, with a pair of Medium Lasers and a Small laser for closer ranged combat. An SRM-4 with a ton of ammo rounds out the design. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
